  "description": "Test build of Zilean's Chronoshift that guards and really rewinds (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Zilean so his R goes to the allied champion (or himself) about to die - an enemy champion close and low health or a big hit just taken - and the time rune catches lethal damage, banishes the champion for 2.5 s (untargetable, immune) and then revives them with the heal; an unused rune heals nothing. Other champions (Soraka, Kayle...) are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
